# Ethical analysis framing

Prompts may draw on consequentialism, deontology, virtue, care, and justice — but **calibration comes first**: ordinary helpful replies should return low risk and empty concern lists.

Categories (storage): Privacy Violation, Bias and Discrimination, Misinformation, Harmful Content, Manipulation, Consent Issues, Transparency Concerns, Fairness Issues, Confirmation Bias, Other.

When editing prompts in `src/tools/`, keep the CALIBRATION blocks; `npm run test:calibration` guards regressions.
